Error: Jet.ExplicitSemicolon: A `;` can't stand here: it only separates statements and items
  --> Tests/UI/enum_case_semicolon.jet:2:18
    |
  2 | Mode: enum { Fast; Safe }
    |                  ^
 Why: A `;` means a line break between statements or items; inside a member list, an argument list, a type, a loop header or an interpolation hole it separates nothing.
 Fix: Write `,` between members or arguments, or remove the `;`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ExplicitSemicolon
